{"title":"탑클래스 마스터의 귀환","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=J2DKP/dJMb9VTWmCJ/SKKTpLusJCyDwkTKDOAYq1&filename=th3","synopsis":"모든 강자들이 선망하는 별, 하온스의 탑클래스 마스터＇레이＇.\n\n레이는 신이 되기 위한 마지막 관문을 앞두고 \n부마스터 '아누스'에게 배신당해 죽는다.\n그리고 일진에게 짓밟히고 약혼녀도 지킬 수 없었던 \n'최강 찌질이 강태욱'이었던 시절로 회귀하는데...\n\n과거의 자신이 이루지 못했던 일들, \n과거의 자신을 무시하고 배신했던 이들을 향해 다시 한번 복수의 칼을 빼든 강태욱.\n\n그러나 그가 비참한 과거를 살아야 했던 원인은 따로 있었다.\n\n파헤칠수록 깊어지는 음모의 심연을 향해 뛰어든 강태욱,\n피에 젖은 인생 2회차가 시작된다!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":95,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":74,"change":{"type":"up","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":77,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":70,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":33,"change":{"type":"up","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":78,"change":{"type":"down","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":45,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":71,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":76,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":92,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":181,"change":{"type":"down","amount":89}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":219,"change":{"type":"down","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":224,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":129,"change":{"type":"up","amount":95}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":66,"change":{"type":"up","amount":63}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":70,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":83,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":65,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":76,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":149,"change":{"type":"down","amount":73}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":116,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":101,"change":{"type":"up","amoun